    The owner-approved working legal-basis policy and pilot scope decision were recorded on 21 October 2026. Final publication remains gated on actual provider-region/transfer/retention evidence, public/private-field and deletion checks, deployed contact-form delivery, and resolving or sanitising the exceptional Storage rollback error-detail path. This draft is not a legal-compliance certificate. The deployed browser/network/cookie check was completed and owner-approved on 21 October 2026; no private residential address or fictitious business entity has been added.
